WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.688
Let's walk through this proof: Sum of

00:00:03.688 --> 00:00:06.677
angles in a triangle is 180°.

00:00:06.677 --> 00:00:08.670
Start with triangle ABC.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:13.044
Draw a line through A parallel to BC.

00:00:13.044 --> 00:00:17.290
Parallel Postulate allows construction of a unique parallel line.

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.452
Alternate interior angles are equal.

00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:26.600
Alternate interior angles formed by a transversal crossing parallel lines are equal.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.201
These three angles form a straight line.

00:00:30.201 --> 00:00:34.060
Angles on a straight line sum to 180 degrees.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:39.168
Therefore, the sum of triangle angles is 180°.

00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:43.676
So, in summary: The proof is logically sound

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:47.620
and uses standard geometric constructions and properties.
